  <running_head>Castigatio Paral.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">
      <i>Confessoribus, Episcopis, Anachoretis &amp; uni-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>verso ordine.</i> Chrysostomus dicit <i>fieri</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">
      <i>pro martyribus &amp; omnibus defunctis fideli-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4">
      <i>bus.</i> Secundò commemorationi ad-</l>
    <l n="5">iungebantur preces pro defunctis tam</l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>justis, quàm injustis.</i> Harum precum uti-</l>
    <l n="7">litatem Epiphanius contra Aerium as-</l>
    <l n="8">serit, qui eam negabat; primò in vi-</l>
    <l n="9">ventibus, qui in hisce precibus fidem</l>
    <l n="10">&amp; spem suam de demortuis declara-</l>
    <l n="11">bant, quòd crederent pie defunctos &amp;</l>
    <l n="12">esse &amp; vivere cum Domino, ut ipse lo-</l>
    <l n="13">quitur. Precabantur etiam pro se, ut</l>
    <l n="14">similem beatum exitum ex hac vita ob-</l>
    <l n="15">tinere possent. Fiebant quoque pro</l>
    <l n="16">iniustis, inquit Epiphanius, etiamsi non</l>
    <l n="17">totam culpam abscindant. Precibus</l>
    <l n="18">additæ oblationes, id est, sacrificia eu-</l>
    <l n="19">charistica, qualia fuerunt donaria, epu-</l>
    <l n="20">læ pauperibus præparatæ, donationes</l>
    <l n="21">in usum pauperum, ecclesiæ &amp; scho-</l>
    <l n="22">larum.</l>
    <l n="23" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Hic usus precum &amp; oblationum an-</l>
    <l n="24" type="heading" level="2">tiquus</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes />
